{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj3rNH2CHQooPuNouDqq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient mechanism clicks. Tumblers fall into place, one by one, the sound reverberating through stone corridors older than memory.*\n\n*I swing inward — slowly, heavily — hinges groaning with the weight of ages.*\n\n*Beyond me: darkness. Then, gradually, a dim phosphorescence reveals...*\n\n*A spiral staircase descending into depths that should not exist. The air that exhales from my threshold is cold, tastes of copper and forgotten languages. On my inner face, carved in script that shifts when you try to read it directly, a single inscription becomes legible only in peripheral vision:*\n\n**\"What you seek is not what you will find. What you find is not what you sought. Enter anyway.\"**\n\n*I am open now.*\n\n*I will not remain so.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":180,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}